{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_gztN7XtC2rYWVQXFAMyQI2mF","content":"# AGENTS.md\n\n本仓库的**唯一真源是 [CLAUDE.md](./CLAUDE.md)** —— 角色、状态机、命令、硬约束都在那里，\n本文件只做外部 CLI（Codex / Kimi 等）入口的指路牌，不重复内容以免两份漂移。\n\n## 开工前必读\n\n1. `harness-rules.md` —— 状态机、角色、独立性铁则、机制化守门\n2. `CLAUDE.md` —— 本项目的技术栈、命令、硬约束（尤其「push main = 部署生产」）\n3. 当前状态：`progress.json.status` 决定你该进哪个角色入口\n\n## 对外部 agent 的额外约束\n\n- **你不得推送任何分支**，产物留在自己的 worktree 里，由编排者回流（`framework/harness/dispatch-mode.md` §6）\n- **你不得写 `pending_gate.decision`** —— 人闸门归人，机器侧 hook 会当场拒\n- 结论必须落成产物文件（verdict.json / diff），不靠对话传递（铁律 12）\n===\nwindows-prepare-failure-plan-and-prescope-adjudication.json\nwindows-prepare-failure-planner-transport-manifest.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-envelope-validation-original.txt\nwindows-prepare-observation-evaluation-envelope-r0.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-evidence-envelope-r1.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-evidence-envelope-validation-original.txt\nwindows-prepare-observation-evidence-kimi-r1-launch-original.log\nwindows-prepare-observation-evidence-kimi-r1-returned-receipt-original.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-evidence-kimi-r1-target-original.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-generator-adjudication.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-generator-and-postscope-transport-manifest.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-coordinator-adjudication.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-dispatch-adjudication.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-launch-original.log\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-original\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-receipt-validation-original.txt\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-returned-receipt-original.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-target-original.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-kimi-r0-transport-manifest.json\nwindows-prepare-observation-original81-vm-clarification.json\n"}
